        },
        {
          "text": "Lino lailila bana ba-Israyeli kuti bakuletele mafuta aasalala aamaolifa aatwidwe aakumunisya, kuti ilampi kaliyaka lyoonse. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
